# Every acceptance scenario the `nodera-test` tool knows about.
#
# The registry discovers scenarios through this file rather than through a list in the runner,
# because the shell batch it replaces carried an ALL_SUITES=(…) array and a suite added without
# touching it existed as a file nobody ran. A class here is a scenario that runs; a class missing
# from here is invisible, which is the one failure mode this file has and the reason
# `nodera-test list` is the smoke test that it is complete.
#
# Order does not matter: the registry sorts headless work before live work itself.
